          OQ7Prescribed.remainderPotentialBound k p S * MeasureTheory.volume K ^ (1 / 2)
OQ7Prescribed.remainderPotential_enorm_le : ∀ (k : ℝ) (p : OQ7Prescribed.CompactPolarization) (S : ℝ)
